{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13537","headline":"回军跛者 · 赵徵明","name":"回军跛者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"既老又不全，始得离边城。\n一枝假枯木，步步向南行。\n去时日一百，来时月一程。\n常恐道路旁，掩弃狐兔茔。\n所愿死乡里，到日不愿生。\n闻此哀怨词，念念不忍听。\n惜无异人术，倏忽具尔形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵徵明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}